44-c9fc-5479-810a-e853c852a36f" 13194139535738 true] [17592186364088 1145 "We use the following facts: \n\n- The determinant of a product is equal to the product of the determinants.\n\n- The determinant of an orthogonal matrix $P$ is equal to $\\pm 1.$\n\nApplying these ideas, we get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\text{det}(PQ)| & =|\\text{det}(P)\\cdot \\text{det}(Q)| \\\\  & =|(\\pm 1)\\cdot \\text{det}(Q)| \\\\  & =|\\pm 1|\\cdot |\\text{det}(Q)| \\\\  & =|\\text{det}(Q)| \\\\  & =|5\\cdot 5-\\sqrt{2}\\cdot 4\\sqrt{2}| \\\\  & =17\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535738 true] [17592186364089 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364090 13194139535738 true] [17592186364089 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364091 13194139535738 true] [17592186364089 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364092 13194139535738 true] [17592186364089 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364093 13194139535738 true] [17592186364089 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364094 13194139535738 true] [17592186364089 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535738 true] [17592186364089 1041 "selection" 13194139535738 true] [17592186364089 1104 #edb/ref 17592186364092 13194139535738 true] [17592186364089 1110 #uuid "41db1663-b0d5-5891-b291-1bea9e785b8d" 13194139535738 true] [17592186364090 1034 "-8" 13194139535738 true] [17592186364090 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535738 true] [17592186364090 1111 #uuid "86b85a3c-3ef6-51ff-a448-7f6ee8073477" 13194139535738 true] [17592186364091 1034 "25-\\sqrt{33}" 13194139535738 true] [17592186364091 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535738 true] [17592186364091 1111 #uuid "c6e08f5a-558a-541d-a731-a1c76fcf2fd5" 13194139535738 true] [17592186364092 1034 "17" 13194139535738 true] [17592186364092 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535738 true] [17592186364092 1111 #uuid "2d2db637-24c5-5802-9260-455f8a32ef52" 13194139535738 true] [17592186364093 1034 "2\\sqrt{2}" 13194139535738 true] [17592186364093 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535738 true] [17592186364093 1111 #uuid "08783865-4f80-58aa-a1d5-c20710221297" 13194139